# builder-snapshot: creates frozen copy without freezing the builder
[b: [make-builder]
 _: [builder-set "x" 1 b]
 snap: [builder-snapshot b]
 _: [builder-set "y" 2 b]
 final: [builder-finish b]]{snap: snap  final: final}
=== out
Dict({"snap": Dict({"x": Int(1)}), "final": Dict({"x": Int(1), "y": Int(2)})})
